<p><span><span>（按学者姓氏拼音首字母及学科分类排序）</span></span></p></section></section><section><p><span><span>高被引科学家（Highly Cited Researchers, HCR）榜单由科睿唯安研究发布，面向全球科学家，旨在遴选全球高校、研究机构和商业组织中对所在研究领域具有重大和广泛影响的顶尖科学人才，基于文献计算量学方法遴选具有引文影响力的学者。</span></span></p><p><span><span>恭喜各位老师！</span></span></p><p><span><span>华农将以更大力度推进学科建设</span></span></p><p><span><span>以创新为引擎</span></span></p><p><span><span>夯实发展根基</span></span></p><p><span><span>让我们同心同向，再攀高峰！</span></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9pibyuqh64zAgCGVxbnW7xHrstagCftqibD11uHk1kXhFnIRU7lgjcVySzHKpYZAsymf6RkSdknmQg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652864578&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0d417ca2ce0eb14dfdfd8d0bbb3902df&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlciclG2CzVpMnT5QT9ArOxjUUQLkZyNLLB4epMcVLLootANpiao5kfMt7lDtZHFQic7icS3oWwF1V8hTSQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><strong></strong><span>华农一周活动速览 | 宠物嘉年华来啦！ </span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652864429&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=67830f1e299cd116404293c4cbcaf7fb&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlciclG2CzVpMnT5QT9ArOxjUUxw9MTSoThaWNCDE6nWJicwpnAPEjb63Uoj52MbR2r9jkTVopXuAupuA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;f